```

## Impact

Intended functionality is broken, considering any function/contracts that needs to query this to execute it's flow would always revert [here](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-superposition/blob/4528c9d2dbe1550d2660dac903a8246076044905/pkg/sol/OwnershipNFTs.sol#L91-L95).

