```

This function calculates the `X96` encoded square root price for a given tick index.

Per the [documentation](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-superposition/blob/4528c9d2dbe1550d2660dac903a8246076044905/README.md#L71) this should be the same as is done in the Uniswap instance, see https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d8b1c635c275d2a9450bd6a78f3fa2484fef73eb/contracts/libraries/TickMath.sol#L23-L54:

