## Impact
Detailed description of the impact of this finding.

While Stylus may provide some protection against reentrancy attacks, adding explicit reentrancy guards ensures that the contract is fully secure when interacting with external token contracts. Reentrancy could lead to unauthorized withdrawals or other unintended consequences.

## Proof of Concept
